OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,FFirst Minister John Swinney has said
OL,7,Fthe Cairngorms National Park wildfire
OL,8,Fis still a "very serious situation".
OL,10,FPolice Scotland declared a major
OL,11,Fincident on Friday night and homes
OL,12,Faround Nethy Bridge were evacuated as
OL,13,Fa precaution after changes in wind
OL,14,Fconditions accelerated the spread of
OL,15,Fthe wildfire.
OL,17,FThe declaration was lifted late on
OL,18,FSaturday and residents were allowed to
OL,19,Freturn home after the wildfire was no
OL,20,Flonger considered an "immediate
OL,21,Fthreat".
OL,26,@pD@LOUpD@cO]|D@VOU}D@GO]
