OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,FSuperintendent Judy Hill, of Police
OL,7,FScotland, said there is "no longer the
OL,8,Fimmediate threat which prompted the
OL,9,Fevacuation of properties in Nethy
OL,10,FBridge".
OL,12,FThis is thanks to the efforts of "fire
OL,13,Fcrews, gamekeepers, contractors,
OL,14,Fpartners and many others over the past
OL,15,F24 hours", she said.
OL,26,@oD@YOUrD@GO]tD@bOUwD@IO]
