OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,FThe Scottish Government said a fire
OL,7,Fbreak around the village was
OL,8,Festablished overnight, and new breaks
OL,9,Fare being constructed as Scottish Fire
OL,10,Fand Rescue Service (SFRS) deploys
OL,11,Fadditional resources.
OL,13,FPolice said more residents were
OL,14,Fevacuated in a small area of
OL,15,Fproperties north-west of Dorback Lodge
OL,16,F(Lain Thatchan) on Saturday morning as
OL,17,Fa precaution.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
