OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,FThe Scottish Government reconvened a
OL,7,Fresponse meeting of the Scottish
OL,8,FGovernment's Resilience Room (SGoRR)
OL,9,Fat 7am on Saturday to review the
OL,10,Fposition on the wildfire.
OL,12,F"This continues to be a very serious
OL,13,Fsituation," The First Minister said.
OL,15,F"Residents, businesses and people
OL,16,Fstaying in the affected areas will
OL,17,Funderstandably be very worried. My
OL,18,Fthoughts are with them and I thank
OL,19,Fthem for their understanding.
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@KO]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
