OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785020582
OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,F"With the fire changing to be in the
OL,7,Fdirection of Nethy Bridge yesterday
OL,8,Fafternoon, a precautionary evacuation
OL,9,Fwas put in place and a fire break was
OL,10,Fsuccessfully established overnight to
OL,11,Fprotect the village.
OL,13,F"Police officers visited all
OL,14,Fproperties in Nethy Bridge and
OL,15,Fofficers are in the village today to
OL,16,Fsupport residents.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785020582
OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,F"The wind has changed direction
OL,7,Fovernight, which means the track of
OL,8,Fthe fire has altered once again and
OL,9,Fthe threat to Nethy Bridge has
OL,10,Freduced, for the moment at least.
OL,12,F"Ground and helicopter resources are
OL,13,Fbeing focused on the current path of
OL,14,Fthe fire and new fire breaks
OL,15,Fconstructed."
OL,17,FThe First Minister said such
OL,18,Fsituations can change "very quickly
OL,19,Fand dramatically", reflecting the
OL,20,Fchallenges faced by SFRS and the other
OL,21,Fresponders.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@MO]zD@WOU{D@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785020582
OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,F"It does not mean, however, that
OL,7,Fanyone should return to that area
OL,8,Funtil they been given the go-ahead to
OL,9,Fdo so," Mr Swinney said.
OL,11,F"Further decisions will be taken later
OL,12,Ftoday by the Local Resilience
OL,13,FPartnership and the Scottish
OL,14,FGovernment Resilience Group will also
OL,15,Freconvene."
OL,17,FThe First Minister said he was
OL,18,F"extremely grateful" to the emergency
OL,19,Fservices and all those involved in
OL,20,Ftackling the fire.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@GO]sD@AOUwD@KO]zD@AOUzD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
