PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785020582
OL,3,CCairngorms wildfire a 'very serious
OL,4,Csituation', John Swinney says
OL,6,FHe reiterated that people in the area
OL,7,Fmust follow the advice of emergency
OL,8,Fservices and the Cairngorms National
OL,9,FPark.
OL,11,F"It is essential people avoid the
OL,12,Faffected areas," Mr Swinney said.
OL,14,FThe Scottish Government's response
OL,15,Fmeeting was attended by several
OL,16,Fministers and representatives from
OL,17,Femergency services, including SFRS and
OL,18,FPolice Scotland.
OL,26,@sD@AOUtD@PO]
